    <title>When the World&#x27;s WORST Golfers Took on TPC Sawgrass 😭</title>
    <link>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZVBcgwf0Aig</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZVBcgwf0Aig</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Mar 2026 17:04:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <dc:creator>Skratch</dc:creator>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;Many amazing things came out of the 1980s, but maybe none more so than the World&#x27;s Worst Avid Golfer contest held at TPC Sawgrass.

It&#x27;s when we met the then 31-year-old Angelo Spagnolo, who put on the performance of a lifetime. No spoilers here, but once you see what Angelo did at the famous 17th island green, you probably won&#x27;t feel so bad about your own game.

The intersection of golf and culture.

Behind every drained putt or hosel rocket into the stands is a human being with complex emotion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZVBcgwf0Aig"&gt;Watch on YouTube&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
